    "title": "WALNUT HOME SALE TOPS $3M",
    "text": "Thursday, September 18, 2025\nThe property at 25 Walnut St. was sold Sept. 15 for $3.33 million, according to Residential Properties Ltd., which makes it the fifth-highest single-family home sold in Jamestown in 2025. The four-bedroom, three-bathroom shingle-style residence is reminiscent of the neighborhood’s iconic 19th century summer cottages. RPL sales associate Jim DeRentis represented the seller; Kate Rooney, of Gustave White Sotheby’s Realty, represented the buyer.",
